WEBVTT

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:34.540
Iden: The satellites for Operation Cinder have been delivered to Admiral Versio. Our next mission is equally important. Inferno has clearance to access one of the Emperor’s classified Observatories buried on the planet Pillio. It contains dangerous artifacts our enemies could use against the galaxy. The Observatory is protected by a Mantle Defense System. Agent Meeko, we need your technical expertise to disable it. Take what you need for an expedition. Locate and destroy the Observatory.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.000
R2-D2: **(Beeps)**

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:11.160
Luke: If the Empire is here, then what I sensed is true. There must be something special about this place.

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.540
R2-D2: **(Beeps)**

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:17.690
Luke: You stay here, Artoo. Their scanners probably spotted us.
